{
  "uid": "iris-service-overview",
  "title": "Iris inference · Service overview (系统指标)",
  "description": "系统指标：QPS / 延迟 / 错误率。回答「服务本身是否健康」，不涉及模型质量。",
  "tags": [
    "mlops",
    "system-metrics",
    "phase4"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5s",
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "怎么读这块面板",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**系统指标 / System metrics —— 回答「服务本身健不健康」。**\n\n数据来自 FastAPI 的 `http_*` 埋点（prometheus-fastapi-instrumentator），抓取间隔 15s。\n\n- **QPS**：请求速率，单位 req/s。突然掉到 0 通常是服务挂了或上游停了。\n- **延迟 P95**：单位 ms。上涨说明变慢（资源不足、批量变大、依赖变慢）。\n- **错误率**：4xx+5xx 占比。4xx 多半是调用方传参不对（本服务会返回 422），5xx/503 才是服务端问题。\n\n⚠️ 这块面板**不回答**「模型预测得准不准」——那属于模型指标（见 *Model quality & drift signals* 面板）和 Evidently 漂移报告。"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "服务可用性 (up)",
      "description": "Prometheus 抓取目标是否 UP。0 表示抓不到 /metrics。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "up{job=\"iris-inference\"}",
          "legendFormat": "up",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "当前 QPS",
      "description": "最近 1 分钟平均请求速率。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total[1m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "QPS",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "P95 延迟",
      "description": "最近 5 分钟 95 分位请求耗时。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 100
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 500
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "P95",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "错误率 (5m)",
      "description": "4xx+5xx 占全部请求的比例。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"[45]..\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m])) or vector(0), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "错误率",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "QPS（按接口）",
      "description": "每个接口的请求速率，单位 req/s。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
